  "name": "Brazilian Feijoada",
  "subtitle": "Slow-simmered black beans with smoky pork and sausage",
  "description": "A hearty black bean stew layered with dried beef, pork, bacon, sausage, warm spices, and a crisp parsley-orange breadcrumb topping.",
